# Phased workstreams

When splitting work into phases, asking what to do next, or implementing from a
tracker, follow `.cursor/skills/phased-workstream/SKILL.md` and read
`.cursor/workstreams/<slug>.md` (index: `.cursor/workstreams/README.md`). Do not
reconstruct phases from chat. Design plans live in `design/`; see `AGENTS.md` §2.1.
